{
  "title": "Quick Crisp Kenyan Black Bean Hash",
  "description": "A fresh and crisp Kenyan dish featuring fermented black beans, perfect for a brunch mood, made with plant-based friendly ingredients and a touch of beurre-monte for added richness.",
  "cuisine": "Kenyan",
  "diet": [
    "plant-based",
